        },
        {
          "text": "Maze kur’ uwo musi igishitsi ca Isayi kizoba gihagaritswe no kubera amoko ibendera, ico gishitsi ni co amahanga azobariritsa: kand’ uburuhukiro bgiwe buzogira icubahiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
