        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho azokamya rwose ikigobe c’ikiyaga ca Egiputa, azozana umuyaga wiwe ururumba, abāngīrire ukuboko rwa Ruzi, arukubite arucemw’ imigezi ndwi, maz’ ajabutse abantu batarinze gukūra inkweto. ",
